# Tinymist vendors a forked Typst compiler (vendor/typst-*, from
# github.com/Myriad-Dreamin/typst, tag tinymist/v0.15.1) and other git-pinned
# forks (reflexo/typst.ts, typstfmt, docx-rs, xilem/masonry). These remain
# under their own licenses (predominantly Apache-2.0 and MIT); for the Typst
# portions the same third-party components documented in the typst source
# package apply (MIT-licensed excerpts, LPPL translations, BSD-3 Skia
# blending code, Apache-2.0-with-LLVM-exception powi).

Files: vendor/typst-*
 vendor/typst-ansi-hl-*
Copyright: The Typst Project Developers
License: Apache-2.0
Comment: typst-ansi-hl additionally embeds Sublime Text syntax definitions
 and themes via syntect/two-face, which carry their own permissive licenses.

